OL,3,CMan charged with murder of woman at a
OL,4,Cflat in Leeds
OL,6,FA 52-year-old man has been charged
OL,7,Fwith the murder of a woman at
OL,8,FCottingley Towers in Leeds.
OL,10,FColin Mann, of Cottingley Towers, will
OL,11,Fappear Leeds Magistrates' Court on
OL,12,FMonday, 27 July, charged with the
OL,13,Fmurder of Tracy Davenport, aged 58.
OL,15,FWest Yorkshire Police were called to
OL,16,FCottingley Towers at around 11:40pm on
OL,17,FFriday 24 July after a report of
OL,18,Fconcern for persons inside one of the
OL,19,Fflats.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/2
