CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1785181717
OL,3,CMan charged with murder of woman at a
OL,4,Cflat in Leeds
OL,6,FOfficers attended the location and
OL,7,Fdiscovered the body of a 58-year-old
OL,8,Fwoman, who was confirmed dead at the
OL,9,Fscene.
OL,11,FMann was detained in police custody
OL,12,Fafter being charged with the murder of
OL,13,FTracy at a flat in Cottingley Towers
OL,14,Fduring the evening of Friday 24 July.
OL,16,FHer family continues to be supported
OL,17,Fby specially trained officers and
OL,18,Fenquires into the murder remain
OL,19,Fongoing by the Homicide and Major
OL,20,FEnquiry Team.
